const translations={es:{"nav-inicio":"Inicio","nav-nosotros":"Nosotros","nav-servicios":"Servicios","nav-contacto":"Contacto","loader-title":"Cargando blindaje","hero-main-title":"Blindaje perfecto","hero-sub-title":"Protecci\xF3n invisible","badge-years-text":"A\xD1OS","badge-line-1":"BLINDANDO TU SEGURIDAD","badge-line-2":"Y LA DE TU FAMILIA","hotspot-glass":"BLINDAJE DE CRISTALES","hotspot-side":"PROTECCI\xD3N LATERAL","hotspot-runflat":"SISTEMA RUN-FLAT","black-section-title":"Blindajes<br>Armored Security","black-section-p":"Somos una empresa mexicana cuyo principal objetivo es satisfacer necesidades de seguridad, a trav\xE9s de: equipamiento, cursos de capacitaci\xF3n y blindajes, as\xED como con la venta de equipos de seguridad a instituciones p\xFAblicas y privadas con insumos de valor agregado y tecnolog\xEDas de vanguardia. Las instituciones m\xE1s prestigiadas del pa\xEDs han sido testigos de la experiencia y profesionalismo de Armored Security.","service-gov":"Blindaje<br>Gubernamental","service-gov-p":"Protecci\xF3n especializada para funcionarios e instituciones.","service-corp":"Blindaje<br>Empresarial","service-corp-p":"Seguridad integral para ejecutivos y corporativos.","service-private":"Blindaje<br>Particular","service-private-p":"Tranquilidad y seguridad para ti y tu familia.","levels-title":"NIVELES DE BLINDAJE","level-name":"Nivel","cert-bottom-title":"NUESTRAS CERTIFICACIONES Y VINCULACIONES","cert-bottom-text":"En Blindajes Armored Security estamos comprometidos en dar soluciones de seguridad y protecci\xF3n a nuestros clientes. Nuestros Cristales se encuentran en mejora continua para investigaci\xF3n y desarrollo. Contamos con el equipo de expertos que ha desarrollado procesos, materiales y tecnolog\xEDa de \xFAltima generaci\xF3n. Cada d\xEDa somos mejores e innovamos constantemente para el beneficio de nuestros clientes.","parallax-video-title":"Experiencia y calidad","parallax-video-p1":"Contamos con el mejor equipo t\xE9cnico y humano para garantizar la calidad en cada paso del proceso de elaboraci\xF3n del vidrio.","parallax-video-p2":"Nuestro personal est\xE1 altamente capacitado para el manejo de los componentes y el uso de la maquinaria especializada.","parallax-video-p3":"La autoclave, parte fundamental en la elaboraci\xF3n del vidrio est\xE1 catalogada entre las m\xE1s grandes de Am\xE9rica Latina, es por eso que ofrecemos.","contact-title":"CONT\xC1CTANOS","contact-subtitle":"D\xE9janos tus datos y un asesor experto en seguridad se comunicar\xE1 contigo a la brevedad.","form-name":"Nombre completo","form-phone":"Tel\xE9fono","form-email":"Correo electr\xF3nico","form-message":"Mensaje / Requerimiento","form-placeholder-name":"Tu nombre y apellido","form-placeholder-phone":"Tu n\xFAmero de tel\xE9fono","form-placeholder-email":"tu@email.com","form-placeholder-message":"Cu\xE9ntanos c\xF3mo podemos ayudarte...","form-submit":"ENVIAR MENSAJE","footer-tagline":"La seguridad no es una opci\xF3n, es una necesidad.","footer-nav-title":"Navegaci\xF3n","footer-contact-title":"Contacto","footer-rights":"\xA9 2026 Armored Security. Todos los derechos reservados.","footer-privacy":"Pol\xEDtica de Privacidad","nosotros-hero-title-1":"Protecci\xF3n Integral y Tecnolog\xEDa Avanzada","nosotros-hero-title-2":"Un solo equipo, desde la ingenier\xEDa hasta la entrega","nosotros-hero-p1":"En Blindajes Armored Security nos consolidamos como referentes en el sector de seguridad en M\xE9xico. Especializados en blindaje certificado para instituciones y ejecutivos de alto nivel, utilizando tecnolog\xEDas de vanguardia e insumos de valor agregado.","nosotros-hero-p2":"En nuestra divisi\xF3n de vidrios se investiga y prueban materiales garantizando su resistencia. Certificados por H.P. WHITE LABORATORY, INC. HPWLI 10801-01B bajo las m\xE1s estrictas normas de calidad.","nosotros-history-title":"Nuestra Historia","nosotros-history-p1":"Blindajes Armored Security es una empresa mexicana fundada en el a\xF1o 2005, contando as\xED con 20 a\xF1os de experiencia, cuyo principal objetivo es satisfacer necesidades de seguridad, a trav\xE9s de blindajes certificados tanto opaco como transparente a instituciones p\xFAblicas y privadas con insumos de valor agregado y tecnolog\xEDas de vanguardia.","nosotros-history-p2":"Abarcamos todos estos sectores y niveles teniendo la experiencia adecuada en el ramo, hemos trabajado con compa\xF1\xEDas peque\xF1as y grandes, as\xED como desde personas individuales hasta empresas gubernamentales con altos ejecutivos.","nosotros-history-p3":"Nuestro proceso de blindaje inicia con la compra de las unidades m\xE1s recientes en acuerdo comercial con las mejores agencias a nivel nacional, lo que nos permite obtener un precio altamente competitivo para su adquisici\xF3n.","nosotros-blindaje-title":"BLINDAJE","nosotros-blindaje-p1":"En Blindajes Armored Security los veh\xEDculos se prueban bajo las normas de calidad vigentes y se trabaja con la premisa de cuidar la seguridad de los clientes. Las pruebas se hacen para comprobar la seguridad exterior del veh\xEDculo; por esta raz\xF3n, el veh\xEDculo es desmontado en su totalidad.","nosotros-blindaje-p2":"Para el cumplimiento de su principal objetivo, Blindajes Armored Security se apoya en un laboratorio de ensayo bal\xEDstico con la \xFAltima tecnolog\xEDa (Mellrichstadt National Ballistics Laboratory), que certifica el blindaje de veh\xEDculos y materiales anti-bal\xEDsticos.","nosotros-blindaje-p3":"Uno de los valores agregados que Blindajes Armored Security otorga en el proceso industrial, es la incorporaci\xF3n del blindaje al veh\xEDculo desde el inicio del armado, preservando las mismas caracter\xEDsticas del veh\xEDculo original.","ac-thickness":"Espesor de cristales:","ac-ojiva":"Tipo de ojiva:","ac-method":"Metodolog\xEDa de prueba:","ac-equivalent":"Probado con:","ac-caliber":"Calibre:","ac-weight":"Peso de la ojiva (g):","ac-velocity":"Velocidad min. (m/s):","ac-impact":"Impactos:","servicios-hero-title":"NUESTROS SERVICIOS","servicios-grid-p":"Soluciones t\xE1cticas y ejecutivas adaptadas a cada perfil de riesgo.","servicios-click-hint":"Click","servicios-card-gov-title":"Blindaje Gubernamental","servicios-card-gov-p":"Protecci\xF3n estrat\xE9gica dise\xF1ada para funcionarios y unidades de transporte especial.","servicios-card-corp-title":"Blindaje Empresarial","servicios-card-corp-p":"Seguridad integral para altos ejecutivos, manteniendo la discreci\xF3n y comodidad.","servicios-card-priv-title":"Blindaje Particular","servicios-card-priv-p":"Tranquilidad para tu familia con los est\xE1ndares de calidad m\xE1s altos del mercado.","servicios-proceso-title":"Nuestro Proceso Industrial","servicios-step1-title":"Adquisici\xF3n y Recepci\xF3n","servicios-step1-p":"Nuestro proceso inicia con la compra de las unidades m\xE1s recientes, obteniendo precios competitivos. Se realiza un inventario exhaustivo al recibir la unidad.","servicios-step2-title":"Desmontaje y Plantilla","servicios-step2-p":"Se procede al desarmado y elaboraci\xF3n de plantillas para la fabricaci\xF3n de vidrio certificado. Los vidrios se cortan y curvan en hornos especializados.","servicios-step3-title":"Ensamblado en Autoclave","servicios-step3-p":"Ensamblado con materiales como PVB y policarbonato. Ingresan a la autoclave para concluir con un acabado fino.","servicios-step4-title":"Acondicionamiento de Carrocer\xEDa","servicios-step4-p":"Desarmado total para la aplicaci\xF3n de materiales bal\xEDsticos como Acero Bal\xEDstico y Kevlar, integr\xE1ndolos estructuralmente.","servicios-step5-title":"Reensamblaje y Acabado","servicios-step5-p":"Pintura, sellado y ensamble final. Se instalan neum\xE1ticos run flat y se realizan acabados est\xE9ticos.","servicios-ventajas-title":"Ventajas de Blindajes Armored Security","servicios-ventajas-p":"Nuestra diferencia radica en el respeto por la ingenier\xEDa original y el uso de tecnolog\xEDas avanzadas.","servicios-discrecion-title":"Discrecionalidad y Confidencialidad","servicios-discrecion-p":"Atendemos aspectos fundamentales: Uso Civil (aspecto original) y Privacidad Total.","servicios-civil":"Uso Civil:","servicios-civil-text":"El aspecto general luce original, evitando llamar la atenci\xF3n.","servicios-privacidad":"Privacidad Total:","servicios-privacidad-text":"Confidencialidad absoluta en el trato y manejo de informaci\xF3n.","hero-cta":"COTIZAR AHORA"},en:{"nav-inicio":"Home","nav-nosotros":"About Us","nav-servicios":"Services","nav-contacto":"Contact","loader-title":"Loading armor","hero-main-title":"Perfect Shielding","hero-sub-title":"Invisible Protection","badge-years-text":"YEARS","badge-line-1":"ARMORING YOUR SAFETY","badge-line-2":"AND THAT OF YOUR FAMILY","hotspot-glass":"GLASS ARMORING","hotspot-side":"SIDE PROTECTION","hotspot-runflat":"RUN-FLAT SYSTEM","black-section-title":"Armored Security<br>Blindajes","black-section-p":"We are a Mexican company whose main objective is to satisfy security needs through: equipment, training courses, and armoring, as well as the sale of security equipment to public and private institutions with added-value inputs and cutting-edge technologies. The most prestigious institutions in the country have witnessed the experience and professionalism of Armored Security.","service-gov":"Government<br>Armoring","service-gov-p":"Specialized protection for officials and institutions.","service-corp":"Corporate<br>Armoring","service-corp-p":"Integral security for executives and corporations.","service-private":"Private<br>Armoring","service-private-p":"Peace of mind and security for you and your family.","levels-title":"ARMOR LEVELS","level-name":"Level","cert-bottom-title":"OUR CERTIFICATIONS AND AFFILIATIONS","cert-bottom-text":"At Armored Security, we are committed to providing security and protection solutions to our clients. Our Glass is in continuous improvement for research and development. We have a team of experts that has developed processes, materials, and technology of the latest generation. Every day we are better and constantly innovate for the benefit of our clients.","parallax-video-title":"Experience and Quality","parallax-video-p1":"We have the best technical and human team to guarantee quality in every step of the glass manufacturing process.","parallax-video-p2":"Our staff is highly trained for the handling of components and the use of specialized machinery.","parallax-video-p3":"The autoclave, a fundamental part of glass manufacturing, is ranked among the largest in Latin America, which is why we offer.","contact-title":"CONTACT US","contact-subtitle":"Leave us your details and a security expert advisor will contact you shortly.","form-name":"Full Name","form-phone":"Phone","form-email":"Email","form-message":"Message / Requirement","form-placeholder-name":"Your first and last name","form-placeholder-phone":"Your phone number","form-placeholder-email":"you@email.com","form-placeholder-message":"Tell us how we can help you...","form-submit":"SEND MESSAGE","footer-tagline":"Security is not an option, it's a necessity.","footer-nav-title":"Navigation","footer-contact-title":"Contact","footer-rights":"\xA9 2026 Armored Security. All rights reserved.","footer-privacy":"Privacy Policy","nosotros-hero-title-1":"Integral Protection and Advanced Technology","nosotros-hero-title-2":"One single team, from engineering to delivery","nosotros-hero-p1":"At Armored Security, we consolidate our position as a benchmark in the security sector in Mexico. Specialized in certified armoring for institutions and high-level executives, using cutting-edge technologies and value-added resources.","nosotros-hero-p2":"In our glass division, materials are researched and tested guaranteeing their resistance. Certified by H.P. WHITE LABORATORY, INC. HPWLI 10801-01B under the strictest quality standards.","nosotros-history-title":"Our History","nosotros-history-p1":"Armored Security is a Mexican company founded in 2005, now with 20 years of experience, whose main objective is to satisfy security needs through certified opaque and transparent armoring for public and private institutions.","nosotros-history-p2":"We cover all these sectors and levels with the appropriate experience in the field, having worked with small and large companies, individuals, and government institutions with high-level executives.","nosotros-history-p3":"Our armoring process begins with the purchase of the latest units through commercial agreements with the best national agencies, allowing us to obtain highly competitive prices.","nosotros-blindaje-title":"ARMORING","nosotros-blindaje-p1":"At Armored Security, vehicles are tested under current quality standards with the priority of ensuring customer safety. Tests are conducted to verify external vehicle protection; for this reason, the vehicle is completely disassembled.","nosotros-blindaje-p2":"To fulfill our main objective, Armored Security relies on a state-of-the-art ballistic testing laboratory (Mellrichstadt National Ballistics Laboratory) that certifies vehicle armoring and ballistic materials.","nosotros-blindaje-p3":"One of the added values provided in our industrial process is the incorporation of armor from the start of the assembly, preserving the original vehicle's characteristics.","ac-thickness":"Glass thickness:","ac-ojiva":"Warhead type:","ac-method":"Test methodology:","ac-equivalent":"Tested with:","ac-caliber":"Caliber:","ac-weight":"Warhead weight (g):","ac-velocity":"Min. velocity (m/s):","ac-impact":"Impacts:","servicios-hero-title":"OUR SERVICES","servicios-hero-subtitle":"Excellence in Automotive Armoring with Cutting-Edge Technology","servicios-click-hint":"Click","servicios-card-gov-title":"Government Armoring","servicios-card-gov-p":"Strategic protection designed for officials and special transport units.","servicios-card-corp-title":"Corporate Armoring","servicios-card-corp-p":"Integral security for high executives, maintaining discretion and comfort.","servicios-card-priv-title":"Private Armoring","servicios-card-priv-p":"Peace of mind for your family with the highest quality standards.","servicios-proceso-title":"Our Industrial Process","servicios-step1-title":"Acquisition and Reception","servicios-step1-p":"Our process starts with the purchase of the latest units at competitive prices. A thorough inventory is performed upon receipt.","servicios-step2-title":"Disassembly and Templating","servicios-step2-p":"We proceed to disassemble and create templates for the manufacture of certified glass. Glass is cut and curved in specialized kilns.","servicios-step3-title":"Autoclave Assembly","servicios-step3-p":"Assembled with materials such as PVB and polycarbonate. Units enter the autoclave for a fine finish.","servicios-step4-title":"Body Conditioning","servicios-step4-p":"Total disassembly for the application of ballistic materials like Ballistic Steel and Kevlar, integrating them structurally.","servicios-step5-title":"Reassembly and Finishing","servicios-step5-p":"Painting, sealing, and final assembly. Run-flat tires are installed and aesthetic finishes are performed.","servicios-ventajas-title":"Advantages of Armored Security","servicios-ventajas-p":"Our difference lies in the absolute respect for the original engineering and the use of the world's most advanced technologies.","servicios-discrecion-title":"Discretion and Confidentiality","servicios-discrecion-p":"We address two fundamental aspects: Civil Use (original appearance) and Total Privacy.","servicios-civil":"Civil Use:","servicios-civil-text":"The general appearance of the armored unit looks stock, avoiding unwanted attention.","servicios-privacidad":"Total Privacy:","servicios-privacidad-text":"Absolute confidentiality in dealing with your personal information.","hero-cta":"QUOTE NOW"}};window.translations=translations;
